      ],
      "description": "<p>The first time in a round a creature is exposed to the second spawn's corrupting sap, the creature must attempt a DC 44 Will Saving Throw save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected, and is temporarily immune to corrupting sap for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> Intrusive fiendish thoughts and cruel urges well up in the creature's mind, causing the creature to become Off-Guard until the end of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is Confused for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is controlled by the second spawn for 1 minute.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
